# Security Policy

## Reporting a vulnerability

Please report security issues privately — do **not** open a public issue.

- Preferred: open a private security advisory on this repository.
- Or email the maintainers at **security@example.com** (replace with a real
  contact) with details and, if possible, a proof of concept.

You can expect an acknowledgement within a few days. Please allow reasonable
time for a fix before any public disclosure.
